PE 781: Feynman diagram / 费曼图

=== Wick contractions (complete pairings) ===
Number of ways to pair 2n external points into n pairs:
  n= 1: (2n-1)!! =            1
  n= 2: (2n-1)!! =            3
  n= 3: (2n-1)!! =           15
  n= 4: (2n-1)!! =          105
  n= 5: (2n-1)!! =          945
  n= 6: (2n-1)!! =        10395
  n= 7: (2n-1)!! =       135135
  n= 8: (2n-1)!! =      2027025
  n= 9: (2n-1)!! =     34459425
  n=10: (2n-1)!! =    654729075

=== Catalan numbers (planar diagrams) ===
Planar (non-crossing) pairings, or planar tree diagrams:
  C_ 0 =          1
  C_ 1 =          1
  C_ 2 =          2
  C_ 3 =          5
  C_ 4 =         14
  C_ 5 =         42
  C_ 6 =        132
  C_ 7 =        429
  C_ 8 =       1430
  C_ 9 =       4862
  C_10 =      16796
  C_11 =      58786
  C_12 =     208012

=== φ^4 theory: connected vacuum diagrams ===
Connected 4-regular vacuum diagrams (no external legs):
  V=2: 1 (total with 1 internal edges)
  V=4: 4 (total with 2 internal edges)
  V=6: 25 (total with 3 internal edges)
  V=8: 208 (total with 4 internal edges)
  V=10: 2146 (total with 5 internal edges)
  V=12: 26368 (total with 6 internal edges)

=== φ^3 theory: connected vacuum diagrams ===
  V=2: 1
  V=4: 1
  V=6: 4
  V=8: 23
  V=10: 168

=== Sum of diagrams across theories ===
One possible interpretation: sum over all diagram types.
  Cumulative sum example: 416687
